--- no answer yet: refused
$ sh spec-approve.sh --effort <F> --draft <F>/spec/1.md
    gate-answer.sh: no answer for spec-approval on 884fd29f2c8da6b120492b30689b6b14b6d865e380515c88e0d940a410074597
    [exit 1]
--- a draft saved as spec.md by hand is never cut
$ sh context-fingerprint.sh --effort <F>
    context-fingerprint.sh: NOT-APPROVED: spec.md is not the spec the human approved last; approve it with crucible-spec
    [exit 2]
--- yes, then no: refused
$ sh spec-approve.sh --effort <F> --draft <F>/spec/1.md
    gate-answer.sh: the newest answer (event 3) did not accept: Change it
    [exit 1]
--- approved through the gate (the draft is the card)
$ sh spec-approve.sh --effort <F> --draft <F>/spec/1.md
    <F>/events/000005-spec.approved.json
    [exit 0]
    spec.md == draft 1
{"sha256":"884fd29f2c8da6b120492b30689b6b14b6d865e380515c88e0d940a410074597","answer":4}
--- the same yes again: refused
$ sh spec-approve.sh --effort <F> --draft <F>/spec/1.md
